+Show Configuration
+------------------
+
+To inspect the configuration of your application, you can use the
+:func:`config <cli.config_command>` command. It prints the loaded configuration
+as JSON, masking the values of any key containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``,
+``TOKEN``, or ``KEY`` as ``"***"``. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "ENV": "production",
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "TESTING": false,
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***"
+    }
+
+
+
